### Scientific Partners & Campaign Credits

The SEDS Sri Lanka Asteroid Search Campaign is powered by international partnerships across the astronomical community:

- **SEDS Sri Lanka**: National campaign leadership, participant coordination, technical platform development, and aerospace mentorship.
- **International Astronomical Search Collaboration (IASC)**: Campaign provisioning, telescope data pipelines, and discovery validation.
- **Pan-STARRS Observatory (University of Hawaii / Haleakalā)**: Wide-field sky survey imagery and optical telescope infrastructure.
- **NASA Planetary Defense Coordination Office (PDCO)**: Global planetary defense awareness and citizen science support.
- **Minor Planet Center (MPC) & IAU**: International astronomical registry and orbit confirmation authority.

